OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be a few light
OL,6,Fshowers around Fraserburgh and
OL,7,FPeterhead at first. Otherwise it will
OL,8,Fbe a dry day with sunny spells and
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with clear
OL,13,Fspells and light winds allowing a few
OL,14,Ffog patches and a touch of frost to
OL,15,Fdevelop in sheltered glens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA dry start with some
OL,18,Fbrightness but generally clouding over
OL,19,Fthrough the day with the odd spot of
OL,20,Frain or drizzle. Best of any bright,
OL,21,Fwarm spells towards Moray coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
