OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight rain clearing Tuesday
OL,7,Fmorning then sunshine and showers,
OL,8,Fwindy at times. Windy on Wednesday
OL,9,Fwith bright spells, rain likely later,
OL,10,Fthis slowly clearing southeast later
OL,11,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
